# Radar reports on Desktop

Whenever you write a report, profile, investigation summary, or summary of work done, also save it as a `.md` file under `C:\Users\zumah\Desktop\radar_reports\`.

- Use a fresh, descriptive filename. Do not overwrite an unrelated earlier report.
- Do not rely on chat output alone.
- Confirm the written file path at the end of the chat reply.
- This is in addition to printing the findings in chat.
- Do not treat this folder as an excuse to skip a path the user already named; if they specified a filename, use that path.
